                                "sense_id": "d1c25650-e52b-31a3-91b0-3201c8419bba",
                                "text": "Exorcism, unction, the sign of the cross, holy water, infant-communion, and many other childishnesses, were also called \"Apostolic institutions\" — not at first, but long after they were invented, to conceal their real origin […]"
